[191.111668, "o", "induction n as [|n IHn].\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - case. (* Switch to explicit case matching *)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   intros m. simpl.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   rewrite Nat.add_0_r.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
